127	 * proration is recorded in metadata as `chargeCents` so the confirm route debits
128	 * the whole proration back out of the wallet. Since creditCheckoutSession credited
129	 * only the card portion, the wallet naturally absorbs the difference — the wallet
130	 * is never touched before the card clears.
